 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.7667,
   "text": "In this town, the day you turn eighteen, you get your own robot."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.crate",
   "start": 2.7667,
   "end": 6.8,
   "text": "Nobody picks. A crate lands on your doorstep, and whatever is inside is yours for life."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.kinds",
   "start": 6.8,
   "end": 9.5333,
   "text": "It can be huge. It can be tiny. It can be a hero."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.cleaner",
   "start": 9.5333,
   "end": 12.0,
   "text": "Or it can be a cleaner that loses fights to dust."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.mum",
   "start": 12.0,
   "end": 15.4667,
   "text": "My mum got a butler. He has poured her tea every morning for twenty years."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.dad",
   "start": 15.4667,
   "end": 16.9333,
   "text": "My dad got a foot massager."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.whole",
   "start": 16.9333,
   "end": 20.0,
   "text": "That is the whole robot. He says it is the best thing that ever happened to him."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.hear",
   "start": 20.0,
   "end": 21.3333,
   "text": "Mum pretends not to hear that."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.friends",
   "start": 21.3333,
   "end": 23.6667,
   "text": "Then my friends turned eighteen, one by one."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.smart",
   "start": 23.6667,
   "end": 26.5333,
   "text": "One got a robot so smart it did her homework and then corrected the teacher."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.hand",
   "start": 26.5333,
   "end": 29.1333,
   "text": "One got a floating hand that follows him around and carries his bag."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.nora",
   "start": 29.1333,
   "end": 32.8,
   "text": "And Nora got a shield robot. Nothing gets through it. Not even dodgeballs."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.turn",
   "start": 32.8,
   "end": 34.7667,
   "text": "Then it was my turn. My crate was very small."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.open",
   "start": 34.7667,
   "end": 36.4,
   "text": "I opened it. Inside was a head."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.just",
   "start": 36.4,
   "end": 39.9333,
   "text": "Just a head. One robot head, no body, no arms, no instructions."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.shook",
   "start": 39.9333,
   "end": 42.0333,
   "text": "I shook the crate for the rest of him. Nothing."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.tuesday",
   "start": 42.0333,
   "end": 45.0333,
   "text": "Dad said, \"Maybe the body is coming on Tuesday.\" It was not."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.school",
   "start": 45.0333,
   "end": 46.9333,
   "text": "I took it to school anyway. That was a mistake."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.talk",
   "start": 46.9333,
   "end": 49.9333,
   "text": "\"Does it talk?\" No. \"Does it walk?\" It is a head."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.off",
   "start": 49.9333,
   "end": 52.2667,
   "text": "Somebody asked if I had tried turning it off and on again."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.laugh",
   "start": 52.2667,
   "end": 55.5667,
   "text": "The whole class laughed. Even the floating hand slapped a desk."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.home",
   "start": 55.5667,
   "end": 58.5,
   "text": "I smiled. I went home. I was not smiling at home."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.lunch",
   "start": 58.5,
   "end": 61.0,
   "text": "Then one day, at lunch, somebody got picked on."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.brick",
   "start": 61.0,
   "end": 63.8,
   "text": "Brick has a robot he wears: two giant metal arms."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.pip",
   "start": 63.8,
   "end": 66.8333,
   "text": "Pip has a robot too. It is a pair of glasses that knows everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.knew",
   "start": 66.8333,
   "end": 69.1333,
   "text": "It knew exactly how much trouble Pip was in."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.lift",
   "start": 69.1333,
   "end": 71.4333,
   "text": "Brick lifted him up by the backpack, with one finger."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.stood",
   "start": 71.4333,
   "end": 73.2667,
   "text": "I felt bad for him. So I stood up."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.down",
   "start": 73.2667,
   "end": 74.6667,
   "text": "I said, \"Put him down.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.looked",
   "start": 74.6667,
   "end": 77.3333,
   "text": "Brick looked at me. Then he looked at what was in my hands."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.head",
   "start": 77.3333,
   "end": 79.2667,
   "text": "I looked too. I was holding a head."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.sat",
   "start": 79.2667,
   "end": 80.0667,
   "text": "I sat down again."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.night",
   "start": 80.0667,
   "end": 82.2667,
   "text": "That night I put the head on my desk and stared at it."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.how",
   "start": 82.2667,
   "end": 83.4333,
   "text": "How do you use a head?"
  },
  {
   "id": "8.nose",
   "start": 83.4333,
   "end": 86.4,
   "text": "I turned it over. I looked in its ears. I looked up its nose."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.button",
   "start": 86.4,
   "end": 89.7667,
   "text": "And there, at the back, under the dust, was one small button."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.press",
   "start": 89.7667,
   "end": 90.4667,
   "text": "I pressed it."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.opened",
   "start": 90.4667,
   "end": 92.1667,
   "text": "The head opened, like a helmet."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.on",
   "start": 92.1667,
   "end": 93.1333,
   "text": "So I put it on."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.metal",
   "start": 93.1333,
   "end": 97.5333,
   "text": "Metal ran down my neck. Over my arms. Down my legs. All the way to my toes."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.armor",
   "start": 97.5333,
   "end": 100.7,
   "text": "I was wearing armor. Sleek, silver, head to toe."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.suit",
   "start": 100.7,
   "end": 102.9,
   "text": "It was never a broken robot. It was a suit."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.forest",
   "start": 102.9,
   "end": 105.5333,
   "text": "I went to the forest, where nobody could see me fall over."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.beam",
   "start": 105.5333,
   "end": 108.3667,
   "text": "I held out my hand, and a beam of light cut a tree in half."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.sorry",
   "start": 108.3667,
   "end": 109.3667,
   "text": "Sorry, tree."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.feet",
   "start": 109.3667,
   "end": 111.8333,
   "text": "Then my feet lit up, and I was flying."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.badly",
   "start": 111.8333,
   "end": 113.6333,
   "text": "Badly. But flying."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.saw",
   "start": 113.6333,
   "end": 115.8667,
   "text": "Then I saw somebody below me, between the trees."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.old",
   "start": 115.8667,
   "end": 118.5,
   "text": "An old man, alone, with his legs shaking."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.lost",
   "start": 118.5,
   "end": 120.7,
   "text": "I thought he was lost. I thought he needed help."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.landed",
   "start": 120.7,
   "end": 122.5333,
   "text": "So I landed, and I walked over to him."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.suit",
   "start": 122.5333,
   "end": 125.9,
   "text": "In half a second, he was not an old man. He was wearing a suit too."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.katana",
   "start": 125.9,
   "end": 128.2333,
   "text": "A katana slid out of his arm, and he jumped at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.duck",
   "start": 128.2333,
   "end": 130.1667,
   "text": "My helmet said one word: \"Duck.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "12.ducked",
   "start": 130.1667,
   "end": 132.8,
   "text": "I ducked. The blade went over my head and into a tree."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.more",
   "start": 132.8,
   "end": 134.3667,
   "text": "And that was not all his robot could do."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.cannon",
   "start": 134.3667,
   "end": 136.2333,
   "text": "His other arm folded open into a cannon."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.fired",
   "start": 136.2333,
   "end": 138.3333,
   "text": "He pointed it at me, and it lit up."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.fast",
   "start": 138.3333,
   "end": 141.4333,
   "text": "It was too fast. I could not move. I could not even blink."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.bush",
   "start": 141.4333,
   "end": 143.0,
   "text": "Then somebody jumped out of a bush."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.nora",
   "start": 143.0,
   "end": 144.4667,
   "text": "Nora. And her shield."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.blast",
   "start": 144.4667,
   "end": 146.5,
   "text": "The blast hit it and went straight up into the sky."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.gone",
   "start": 146.5,
   "end": 149.5,
   "text": "The old man looked at her. He looked at me. And then he was gone."
  },
  {
   "id": "15.who",
   "start": 149.5,
   "end": 151.5333,
   "text": "I said, \"Who was that? Why me?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "15.threw",
   "start": 151.5333,
   "end": 153.9,
   "text": "She said, \"That is the one this town threw out.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "15.broke",
   "start": 153.9,
   "end": 157.4,
   "text": "\"He got his robot at eighteen, like everybody. He used it to break things.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "15.took",
   "start": 157.4,
   "end": 159.8,
   "text": "\"They took it away from him, a long time ago.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "15.helmet",
   "start": 159.8,
   "end": 162.6333,
   "text": "Then she looked at my helmet, and she stopped talking."
  },
  {
   "id": "15.sub",
   "start": 162.6333,
   "end": 164.3333,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part two."
  }
 ],
